00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.770
What's this?!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.830
Another new model?! A Gundam?!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:13.120
What's going on?! We don't have any data on this thing...

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:13.670
Auel!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:18.920
What?!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.350
Damn you!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.770
<i>Shinn! Your orders are to capture them!</i>

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:34.730
You do understand that, right?! Those are our property!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.690
<i>I know that! I don't know if I can take them though!</i>

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.700
<i>How did this happen in the first place?!</i>

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.370
How could we let the enemy steal them so easily?!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.500
Now's not the time for chitchat!

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:59.000
This isn't practice! Concentrate on the battle!

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:02.300
If they're here on a capture mission,

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.890
there should be a carrier waiting outside.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.010
<i>See anything?</i>

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.230
I don't need Gladys to tell me! I know!

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.900
Tell her not to interfere with issues under my jurisdiction!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.820
Okay, let's go! Inconspicuously, though.

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:29.940
Aim Gottfrieds one and two!

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:33.460
Load missile launchers one through eight with Korinthos!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.220
<i>Crafts Izawa and Harada, proceed to catapult.</i>

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.590
Main guns target the portside Nazca Class!

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:42.610
Disengage Mirage Colloid upon firing.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.380
Engines to maximum.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:48.350
Now, things are finally gonna get interesting, gentlemen.

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.560
Gottfrieds! Fire!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.770
What was that?!

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.880
The Hershel has been hit!

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:09.330
Missiles approaching Fourier! Eighteen of them!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.340
Unidentified vessel located! One vessel!

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:14.900
Location Orange 25, Mark 8, Bravo, distance: 2300!

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.260
That close?!

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:17.290
Mirage Colloid?!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.060
Are they Earth Forces?!

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:21.710
Searching heat pattern library. No match found!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.630
<i>Counterattack! Send out the ships and Mobile Suits!</i>

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.510
Nazca Class approaching! Distance: 1900!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:32.310
Turn 20 immediately after launching mobile suits!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.560
Main guns target the Nazca Class Indigo!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:36.730
Don't get hit by their gunfire!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.240
What's that?!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.740
Athrun!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.410
We're being attacked from the outside. The harbor?

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:38.870
Bastard!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.840
Damn! This wasn't in our training!

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:51.510
Sting! That's our cue!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:54.300
I know! Our ride's here, right?!

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.560
<i>We're late! The bus'll leave without us!</i>

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:58.880
Yes, I <i>know </i>!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.900
<i>What is that thing?!</i>

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.050
We were told there were only three new models!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:05.340
<i>How should I know?!</i>

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:08.420
So, what do we do?! The plan didn't account for this.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.570
Neo messed up!

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:16.820
But we can't exactly ignore it! It'll be a pain if it comes after us!

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.840
Thinking of bringing its head along as a gift?!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.130
Isn't that the sort of thing lame people do?!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.970
Stella!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.000
Athrun?!

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.080
Hold on!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.120
Gotcha!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.000
What?!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:12.880
Take this!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.640
Cagalli!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.110
Damn it.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.780
I won't let you!

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:41.410
Damn you!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.120
Not today!

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:46.540
Hurry! Just open it enough so that I can get in!

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.340
Rey!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.750
I don't know how much it was damaged!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.920
Don't expect it to operate normally!

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.420
If you think there's a problem, retreat immediately!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.680
Move over, Lunamaria!

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.630
What do you mean we can't use the harbor?!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.060
Medic! Medic!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:13.760
Unload the Homjim Team's GuAIZs!

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.760
Who's in charge here?!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:14.280
Daddy!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:16.210
What about those three machines?!

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.280
Why is this happening?!{I'm not sure what's background/foreground because youtube subs suck}

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:18.300
Explain the situation!

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:18.910
Mr. Chairman!

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.660
This area is still dangerous!

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.680
They've released poison gas!

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.620
Please make your way to the shelter, Mr. Chairman!

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.990
How can I possibly do that?!

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.070
I still don't have a good grasp of the situation!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:34.470
I beg you, sir. At least board the Minerva!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.900
Damn! This new model...

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.860
Chaos, Gaia, and Abyss...

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.570
God dammit, he just won't die!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.740
How could something like this be allowed to happen?!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.330
Damn it!

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.750
There's more!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.300
Auel!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.970
Take this! How dare you try to trick us?!

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.940
Sting! There's no end to this!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.560
{split}My machine's running out of power!

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.280
Let's retreat! Stella!

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:38.340
<i>Can you lose him?!</i>

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.570
I'll destroy him in no time!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.990
This can't be. I... I...

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:49.670
Shinn!

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.830
Retreat! Stop it, Stella!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.400
I can't give in to this guy!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:55.960
<i>Stella!</i>

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.380
Then you'll just hafta die here!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:01.590
Auel!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:06.320
I'll give Neo a message on your behalf! I'll tell 'em you said, "Goodbye"!

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.250
Die?

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.820
<i>Auel! Why did you...</i>

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:21.840
I...

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.200
<i>She wouldn't stop! I had no choice!</i>

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.180
Goodbye?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.450
<i>Shut up, you fool! That was uncalled for!</i>

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.120
No!

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.420
We got what we came for, right?

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:38.590
You're not getting away!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:56.180
Medical Squad D, you're needed in Sector Seven.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.150
<i>Water down the ammunition supplies in Storage Shed number 45.</i>

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.070
Forget about block B as well!

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.070
{?????}Bring all functioning mobile suits to Minerva's docks.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.000
That's right! That includes the wounded!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.140
Athrun?

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:14.330
How are you feeling?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.700
Yeah, I feel fine.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.860
I'm sorry. I just...

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.170
We'll find a safe place to disembark right away.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.010
I'll be fine.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.100
However...

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.140
Nazca Class has been destroyed!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:39.920
GuAIZ approaching from portside rear! Three of them!

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:45.620
Fire anti-beam depth charges and accelerate by 20 percent for ten seconds!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:48.440
Load Sledgehammers into tubes one through four!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.370
Call back our mobile suits!

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:52.940
Have they returned?

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:53.830
Not yet.

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:56.750
Did they fail?

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.220
They may have crushed the harbor, but it's also a weapon factory.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.650
The longer they remain, the more at risk they are.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.920
I know that.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:13.260
But if I thought they would fail, I wouldn't have allowed them to take on this mission.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:16.860
I'll go out and buy us some time.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.310
Take command of the ship.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.060
Yes, sir!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.960
Hangar deck! The Exus is launching! Get ready!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:32.240
These guys are incredible. How can they operate stolen machines so well?!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.450
If they escape, that's it!

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.300
We've gotta stop them from getting away!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.590
I know that, but...

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.920
It's no use! I'm getting nothing from the control room!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.400
Gasses have been released from within the factory.

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:52.100
There's a level four evacuation warning for all districts from Espace to Ronal.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:59.190
Captain. The situation's critical. Should they end up getting away...

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.820
We won't allow that to happen.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:16.540
In any case, I wonder which unit of theirs executed this daring plan.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.350
<i>What was that?!</i>

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:40.850
Mr. Chairman!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.320
What's the situation?! What's going on?!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.280
Damn it!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:04.840
Minerva!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.580
<i>Send out the Force Silhouette!</i>

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.240
Captain!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.180
I approve! Send it out!

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:14.050
There's no longer any reason to keep it a secret, is there?

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:15.760
No.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.810
Force Silhouette! Standby for take off!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.190
You're being...

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.280
...a damn pest!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:34.090
<i>Commencing launch sequence for Force Silhouette.</i>

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:39.210
<i>All systems go. Setting Silhouette Flyer on platform.</i>

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:43.170
<i>Central catapult online. Emergency crew, please standby.</i>

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:08.730
This'll do it!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.860
I can't let it happen!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:20.830
I won't let you!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.320
Shinn!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.240
This guy...

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.450
He can change his equipment?!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.340
But just because of that...

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.600
Stop it! Go away!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.900
Fall!

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.720
Damn it!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:48.100
Shinn!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:52.550
Captain!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.510
They're heading out on their own!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:57.680
The enemy vessel is still outside!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.220
The Impulse's power is getting critically low!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.060
300 left at the most!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:09.150
We can't afford to lose the Impulse as well. Launch the Minerva!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.230
Please, Talia.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.200
Who are those two?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.460
Give me that!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.880
You two over there! Don't move!

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:37.520
Commencing Minerva launch sequence.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:40.220
This ship is now switching over to combat status!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:46.680
Gunnery crews, prepare for FCS contact!
Set projectile configurations to grade one!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.850
Mr. Chairman, please prepare to disembark.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:54.400
Talia. Under the circumstances, I can't exactly stay behind and wait for a report.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.030
However...

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.200
I have a duty, and I also have the authority.

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:01.570
I will go with you. Please permit it.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:07.000
<i>This ship is about to take off. All units, please proceed to your stations. I repeat.</i>

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.160
<i>This ship is about to take off.</i>

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:09.160
Don't move!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:12.830
Who are you people? You're not with the Forces, are you?

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.500
What were you doing in that machine?!

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.040
Ath—

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.160
Lower your rifles.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:27.090
This is Miss Cagalli Yula Athha, Chief Representative of the Orb Union.

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:29.380
<i>Don't forget to lock down the equipment!</i>

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.850
I am her attendant, Alex Dino.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:34.310
We got caught up in the commotion while meeting with Chairman Durandal,

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:37.980
and unable to escape, had no choice but to borrow the machine to defend ourselves.

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.150
Athha... of Orb?

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.660
The Representative has been injured!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.120
I understand that the Chairman has also boarded this ship.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.760
I'd like to see him!

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:52.500
Damn! Where'd they go?!

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:56.040
<i>Shinn! Retreat for now. This is just reckless!</i>

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:03.390
I see. I guess this was a mistake on my part.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:10.980
I'm not dead. I'm all right.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.650
I'm all right, aren't I, Stella?

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.690
We have a message from Captain Roanoke!

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:21.650
The message says to advance the Girty Lue to Blue 18, Mark 3, Alpha.

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:29.780
<i>Message for all hands at system control.</i>

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:35.130
<i>As of this moment, LHM-BB01 Minerva's classification code has been validated.</i>

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.090
<i>The Minerva is currently going through emergency launch sequence.</i>

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.010
<i>A55M6 warning alarm activated.</i>

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.430
<i>All dock damage control teams, remain on standby.</i>

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:47.300
<i>Teams two and five, stay alert for any unanticipated damage to the ship's frame.</i>

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:51.220
<i>Gate control, online. Minerva, connecting to descent lift.</i>

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:54.720
<i>Monitor B Team, observe depressurization phase.</i>

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:58.610
Is this ship escaping?

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.780
Is the damage to the PLANT that horrendous?

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.370
Launch gate depressurization complete.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.860
We're ready to go any time.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:13.500
Start engines! The Minerva is taking off! Condition Red!

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.540
The Minerva is taking off. Condition Red announced.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:21.900
<i>Condition Red announced. Pilots are to gather in the briefing room at once.</i>

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:24.900
Is this ship taking off into battle?!

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:26.970
Athrun!

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:29.640
Athrun?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:40.880
From where?!

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:44.920
Now, I think I'll have that machine as well!

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:48.570
Shinn!

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:59.830
<b>tooku hanareteru hodo ni chikaku ni kanjiteru</b>

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:59.830
<b>The further we are apart, the nearer I feel you are</b>

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:10.510
<b>samishisa mo tsuyosa eto kawatteku... kimi wo omottanara</b>

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:10.510
<b>Even my loneliness turns into strength... when I think of you</b>

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:25.870
<b>kotoba wo kasanete mo wakari aenai koto</b>

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:25.870
I still did not realize

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:32.670
<b>
mada shiranakatta ne</b>

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:32.670
That there are things that can't be conveyed even with words

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:40.300
<b>kimi dake wo dakishimetakute nakushita yume kimi wa</b>

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:40.300
My lost dreams of wanting to hold you by my side,

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:47.270
<b>
"akiramenaide" to itta</b>

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:47.270
For them, you said, "Don't give up!"

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:54.110
<b>tooku hanareteru hodo ni chikaku ni kanjiteru</b>

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:54.110
The further we are apart, the nearer I feel you are

00:22:53.390 --> 00:23:02.240
<b>
samishisa mo tsuyosa eto kawatteku... kimi wo omottanara</b>

00:22:53.390 --> 00:23:02.240
Even my loneliness turns into strength... when I think of you

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>setsunaku mune wo sasu sore wa yume no kakera</b>

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:08.950
The thing that pierces the gentle chest, that's a fragment of my dream

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:21.920
<b>
arinomama deaeteta sono kiseki mou ichido shinjite</b>

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:21.920
Believe once more in the the miracle that is our chanced meeting

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.920
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.670
Flames dye the skies.

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:29.340
The sound of roaring gunfire.

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:33.260
Are these signs of something awakening?

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:38.560
What is hidden in the depths of the eyes of the young soldiers who meet?

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:43.520
Next, on Mobile Suit Gundam Seed Destiny,

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:45.570
"Warning Shots."

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:51.950
<b>Next time</b>

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:51.950
<b>Next time</b>

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:51.950
<b>Warning Shots</b>

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:51.950
<b>Warning Shots</b>

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:49.360
Crank up your engine to maximum. Take off, Minerva!
